  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Osso buco is built around "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "braising ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "braising"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": the veal is browned deeply first, then cooked slowly in white wine and stock until the sauce is rich and the meat yields completely. The finishing touch is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gremolata",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gremolata"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of parsley, lemon zest and garlic stirred in off the heat. This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flour the veal pieces well before browning . it helps the crust form quickly and thickens the braising liquid as it cooks. Tie the pieces with kitchen twine if you want to keep them neat, though it is not essential."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
